Description: Serpent and knuth-lfib are left out
 knuth-lfib.c includes code copied verbatim from Knuth's TAoCP, and its
 author did not ask Knuth for permission. The Serpent files are derived
 from Libgcrypt's serpent.c, and the adaptation replaced libgcrypt with
 nettle in their licence template. Without them, libnettle has no
 Serpent ciphers and no knuth_lfib functions, and nettle-dev has no
 serpent.h or knuth-lfib.h. nettle_ciphers no longer lists serpent128,
 serpent192 or serpent256.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-04
---
--- a/Makefile.in
+++ b/Makefile.in
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
